The Regional Government provides facilities to fulfill basic health and welfare rights, by:

a. provision of child-friendly health centers;
b. provision of breastfeeding rooms in Government and private Offices; c. organizing and facilitating Posyandu facilities and infrastructure in every official banjar/neighborhood;
